      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "勱字公濟，通之弟也。",
      "reading": "本卷字公濟，為王通弟；《南史》作公齊。",
      "note": "本卷字公濟，為王通弟；《南史》作公齊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 10,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-10",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "美風儀，博涉書史，恬然清簡，未嘗以利欲干懷。",
      "reading": "本傳從容貌、讀書及不汲利欲敘其性。",
      "note": "本傳從容貌、讀書及不汲利欲敘其性。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 10,
      "end_codepoint": 32,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-32",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "梁世為國子周易生，射策舉高第，除祕書郎、太子舍人、宣惠武陵王主簿、輕車河東王功曹史。",
      "reading": "為國子周易生，射策高第後任祕書郎等，武陵、河東為所仕兩王府。",
      "note": "為國子周易生，射策高第後任祕書郎等，武陵、河東為所仕兩王府。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 32,
      "end_codepoint": 74,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-74",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "王出鎮京口，勱將隨之藩，范陽張纘時典選舉，勱造纘言別，纘嘉其風采，乃曰：「王生才地，豈可游外府乎？」",
      "reading": "河東王蕭譽出鎮。張纘典選，勱來辭行；發問「王生」者為纘，所稱者正是勱。",
      "note": "河東王蕭譽出鎮。張纘典選，勱來辭行；發問「王生」者為纘，所稱者正是勱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 74,
      "end_codepoint": 124,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-124",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "奏為太子洗馬。",
      "reading": "張纘奏勱為太子洗馬。",
      "note": "張纘奏勱為太子洗馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 124,
      "end_codepoint": 131,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-131",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "遷中舍人，司徒左西屬。",
      "reading": "再遷中舍人、司徒左西屬。",
      "note": "再遷中舍人、司徒左西屬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 131,
      "end_codepoint": 142,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence1-142",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "出為南徐州別駕從事史。",
      "reading": "出任南徐州別駕從事史。",
      "note": "出任南徐州別駕從事史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 142,
      "end_codepoint": 153,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "大同末，梁武帝謁園陵，道出朱方，勱隨例迎候，队勱令從輦側，所經山川，莫不顧問，勱隨事應對，咸有故實。",
      "reading": "大同末武帝行經朱方，勱隨例迎候。殿本「勅勱令從輦側」，《南史》為「敕令從輦側」。",
      "note": "大同末武帝行經朱方，勱隨例迎候。殿本「勅勱令從輦側」，《南史》為「敕令從輦側」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 50,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence2-50",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "又從登北顧樓，賦詩，辭義清典，帝甚嘉之。",
      "reading": "勱隨登北顧樓賦詩，得武帝嘉許。",
      "note": "勱隨登北顧樓賦詩，得武帝嘉許。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 50,
      "end_codepoint": 70,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "時河東王為廣州刺史，乃以勱為冠軍河東王長史、南海太守。",
      "reading": "蕭譽以河東王為廣州刺史；勱為其長史及南海太守。",
      "note": "蕭譽以河東王為廣州刺史；勱為其長史及南海太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence3-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "王至嶺南，多所侵掠，因懼罪稱疾，委州還朝，勱行廣州府事。",
      "reading": "侵掠、稱疾還朝者為蕭譽；代理廣州府事者為勱。",
      "note": "侵掠、稱疾還朝者為蕭譽；代理廣州府事者為勱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence3-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "越中饒沃，前後守宰例多貪縱，勱獨以清白著聞。",
      "reading": "地饒而守宰多貪，用以襯勱清白。",
      "note": "地饒而守宰多貪，用以襯勱清白。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence3-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "入為給事黃門侍郎。",
      "reading": "還朝後改任給事黃門侍郎。",
      "note": "還朝後改任給事黃門侍郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 86,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "侯景之亂，西奔江陵，元帝承制以為太子中庶子，掌相府管記。",
      "reading": "侯景亂後奔江陵，梁元帝承制令勱為太子中庶子、掌相府管記。",
      "note": "侯景亂後奔江陵，梁元帝承制令勱為太子中庶子、掌相府管記。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence4-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "出為寧遠將軍、晉陵太守。",
      "reading": "出守晉陵，加寧遠將軍。",
      "note": "出守晉陵，加寧遠將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 40,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence4-40",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "時兵饑之後，郡中凋弊，勱為政清簡，吏民便安之。",
      "reading": "郡在兵荒以後，勱為政清簡，吏民安之。",
      "note": "郡在兵荒以後，勱為政清簡，吏民安之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 40,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence4-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "徵為侍中，遷五兵尚書。",
      "reading": "徵侍中，後遷五兵尚書。",
      "note": "徵侍中，後遷五兵尚書。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 74,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "及西魏寇江陵，元帝徵湘州刺史宜豐侯蕭循入援，以勱監湘州。",
      "reading": "西魏入寇，元帝徵宜豐侯蕭循入援，代監湘州者為王勱。",
      "note": "西魏入寇，元帝徵宜豐侯蕭循入援，代監湘州者為王勱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "江陵陷，敬帝承制以為中書令。",
      "reading": "江陵失陷，敬帝承制以為中書令。",
      "note": "江陵失陷，敬帝承制以為中書令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-42",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "紹泰元年加侍中。",
      "reading": "紹泰元年加侍中。",
      "note": "紹泰元年加侍中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 50,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-50",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "高祖為司空，以勱兼司空長史。",
      "reading": "陳霸先為司空時，勱兼其司空長史。",
      "note": "陳霸先為司空時，勱兼其司空長史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 50,
      "end_codepoint": 64,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-64",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "高祖為丞相，(為)[勱]兼丞相長史，侍中、中書令嵭如故。",
      "reading": "霸先為丞相，勱兼其長史。數位本「(為)[勱]」的改字校記另存，殿本作勱。",
      "note": "霸先為丞相，勱兼其長史。數位本「(為)[勱]」的改字校記另存，殿本作勱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 64,
      "end_codepoint": 92,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-92",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "時吳中遭亂，民多乏絕，乃以勱監吳興郡。",
      "reading": "監吳興為荒亂救乏；殿本正文亦作監，卷末考證另記一本作兼。",
      "note": "監吳興為荒亂救乏；殿本正文亦作監，卷末考證另記一本作兼。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 92,
      "end_codepoint": 111,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-111",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "及蕭勃平後，又以勱舊在嶺表，早有政勣，乃授使持節、都督廣州等二十州諸軍事、平南將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史。",
      "reading": "蕭勃平後授廣州刺史等官，承下句未行；此與前任河東王長史、攝廣州府事分列。",
      "note": "蕭勃平後授廣州刺史等官，承下句未行；此與前任河東王長史、攝廣州府事分列。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 111,
      "end_codepoint": 164,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-164",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "未行，改為衡州刺史，持節、都督嵭如故。",
      "reading": "未赴廣州即改授衡州，持節及都督仍舊。",
      "note": "未赴廣州即改授衡州，持節及都督仍舊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 164,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:received_sentence5-183",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG",
      "source_quote": "王琳據有上流，衡、廣攜貳，勱不得之鎮，留于大庾嶺。",
      "reading": "屯據上流的王琳為會稽將軍王琳。勱因此未到衡州任，留大庾嶺。",
      "note": "屯據上流的王琳為會稽將軍王琳。勱因此未到衡州任，留大庾嶺。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangmai-complete:p005",
